WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.424 --> 00:00:04.047
Unit twenty-one. Chatting Safely Online!

2
00:00:04.952 --> 00:00:10.317
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:13.321
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.371 --> 00:00:17.727
Today we learn about Chatting Safely Online. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.075 --> 00:00:22.697
Chat. Say it with me. Chat!

6
00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:30.135
Message. Say it with me. Message!

7
00:00:33.626 --> 00:00:37.851
Stranger. Say it with me. Stranger!

8
00:00:41.285 --> 00:00:46.509
Personal information. Say it with me. Personal information!

9
00:00:50.038 --> 00:00:53.438
Photo. Say it with me. Photo!

10
00:00:56.942 --> 00:01:00.726
Block. Say it with me. Block!

11
00:01:04.238 --> 00:01:08.238
Report. Say it with me. Report!

12
00:01:11.693 --> 00:01:16.400
Trusted adult. Say it with me. Trusted adult!

13
00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:34.475
When I chat or send a message, I only talk to people I know in real life. I never share personal information or a photo with a stranger. If something feels wrong, I block, report, and tell a trusted adult.

14
00:01:34.525 --> 00:01:37.829
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:38.588 --> 00:01:44.046
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:44.096 --> 00:01:45.246
Stranger!

17
00:01:46.381 --> 00:01:51.978
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:52.028 --> 00:01:53.178
Report!

19
00:01:54.257 --> 00:02:03.010
Did you know? People online are not always who they say they are, which is why we only chat with people we know!

20
00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:05.626
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:06.393 --> 00:02:14.821
Think and answer. What should you do if a stranger messages you?

22
00:02:14.871 --> 00:02:16.021
Great answer!

23
00:02:16.941 --> 00:02:21.837
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:21.887 --> 00:02:25.203
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

